Now everyone can find out how good your kung fu is! 9 Monkeys of Shaolin has been updated with a Leaderboard table, trading cards and profile badges. 

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/32342132/6e44de521fd2635e7d7c2359a25fa29a3d52fdf7.png

Compete with friends and against friends, conquer the top of the ratings and make history as a true Shaolin master! The game is available at 15% discount till December 1st, 2020. 

Details on the update:

Features:

Leaderboards for each level with the ability to view the Global results and the results of your Steam friends.
Trading Cards.
Badges.

Fixes:

balanced the Seal of Attraction;
fixed animation of strikes when they are made from the air;
fixed the ability to press restart after the end of the level in some levels, for example, Sawmill;
removed the ability to change difficulty in the Pause Menu;
fixed a bug with a camera in the Swamp;
fixed a lever/level typo in the Silver Mine;
fixed display of dialogs in Naha Streets when playing in Online co-op mode;
fixed overlapping descriptions in the armory for different screen sizes;
fixed the suicide enemy running out at Poyang Lake;
added auto kill of enemies in the Swamp when they fall down;
fixed a bug with display of some secrets;
fixed the constant display of a new weapon icon on the ship in the camp;
fixed the output of tasks in the location of the Silver Mine.

Enjoy the game!
Sobaka Studio <3

Hi everyone!

Here's our weekly patch notes news! Yesterday we released the 1.03 version of 9 Monkeys of Shaolin, where we fixed the following issues:

— fixed co-op connectivity issues to severely reduce lagging;
— fixed the Lake Poyang mission not being required to unlock the final mission in Chapter 2;
— boss missions now have more distinctive icons on the map;
— fixed second player placement at the start of the encounter in coop when both players are too far away from each other;
— fixed lightning in the Eight Diagrams mission in co-op;
— fixed a bug in the final mission in Chapter 2 where the objective message would appear after you've been killed by the boss.

Once again thank you for your feedback! And now, we're back to work!
